Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:23:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: lid sleep, quiet idle clocks, 6 GHz
 Wi-Fi on the N1

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-5 adds linux-aurora-n1 0013-0016 (lid
sleep from FatBoy721, the 120 Hz present fix from rolotrealanis98) and turns
on UCLAMP_TASK; omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s4 adds edimoldovan's
realtime uclamp sysctl and N1 6 GHz iwd default. Both from
betizzel/omarchy-m5 installer/recipes (ba988ac2).
